<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-BETIS BEAT CELTA 1-0 IN SPANISH CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BETIS BEAT CELTA 1-0 IN SPANISH CUP.</headline>
<dateline>SEVILLE, Spain 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Real Betis managed only a 1-0 victory over Celta Vigo despite dominating much of the first leg of their Spanish Cup semifinal on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Nenad Bjelica scored the only goal midway through the second half.</p>
<p>Barcelona face second division giantkillers Las Palmas in the other semifinal on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
